    "body": "It shouldn't be AFAICT. \r\nBut it's likely that the feature relies on some not-upstreamed Edge-only backend, as the relevant CLs ([1](https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/5247315), [2](https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/5297548)) don't really add any functionality related to the attribute. So maybe [Edge Canary](https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/edge/download/insider?form=MA13FJ) is the way to go for testing this.",
